{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2155d58e102d6a4844bcddd237522b02073580cbe273cab9e2dfc3a47ba98b6d", "ja": "（伊織プロデュースの服の販売が決まり、\n今日は、販促写真を撮る予定になっている）", "zh": "（伊织设计的服装已经确定要销售了，\n今天计划拍摄宣传照片。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1001_007ior", "source_sha256": "f3f3d03db47909e33a79deff3d8d91ed7951df88f843cd8cba8a4047eb47360d", "ja": "カップはこの位置だから、お菓子はこっちに並べて……\nうん、いい感じね。イメージどおりだわ♪", "zh": "杯子要放在这个位置，所以点心就摆在这边……\n嗯，感觉不错。和想象中的一样♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1002_p", "source_sha256": "efab2538a488936bd1975fb5ed961028a220074f4436622aaa75c76b24420fd7", "ja": "よかった。これで準備は終わりだな。\n後は撮影を待つだけだけど……。", "zh": "太好了。这样一来准备就完成了。\n接下来就只等开拍了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1003_p", "source_sha256": "36f22ecad91afca04c2b785d68dc40ffbe1b42ec251a3c4aa6585e6ed66a6fa3", "ja": "撮影までセルフプロデュースをするとは。\n伊織のこだわりの詰まった、いい撮影になりそうだな。", "zh": "竟然连拍摄都要自己操刀制作啊。\n感觉会是一场倾注了伊织的心思、非常棒的拍摄呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1004_007ior", "source_sha256": "5e0299df2ed91d960d8431eca63c275fbaaf56b3de801fb2c0e54e3d0b178335", "ja": "当たり前じゃない！\n今回発売するのは、ただの服じゃないのよ？", "zh": "那是当然的啦！\n这次要发售的，可不是普普通通的衣服哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1005_007ior", "source_sha256": "b532485e8eeb1196bf81c3502212d6fbf23eb59b9dac094c5131f8009accdea6", "ja": "私が手掛けた、特別な一着なんだもの。\n販促も、最高のものじゃなきゃね♪", "zh": "那可是我亲手打造的特别单品呢。\n宣传推广，当然也要做到最好才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1006_p", "source_sha256": "32f1af32503ea65a9d90db46a3e778aac1d75f605225f466d0857912da1e2255", "ja": "そうだな。この服を一番魅力的に見せる術がわかって\nいるのも、間違いなく伊織だもんな。", "zh": "没错。最清楚怎样把这件衣服展现得最迷人的人，毫无疑问就是伊织了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1007_007ior", "source_sha256": "8c7e6c3146151acb2c9698c2c92bebffceaab2835eb516920abc2860bee070b1", "ja": "当然でしょ？　でも、私だけがわかっていても\n意味がないもの。みんなにもわかってもらわなくちゃ♪", "zh": "那当然啦！不过，光是我一个人知道\n可没有意义。必须也让大家都明白才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1008_007ior", "source_sha256": "e495133c66f4fb1ce982a6a34f8bd657ba53f0716157cbd8405d201f3fcb6ed7", "ja": "だからかしら？　\n準備している間も、結構楽しかったのよね。", "zh": "所以才会这样吧？\n就连准备的时候，也相当开心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1009_p", "source_sha256": "839f5fd6cdbafe1158ca846dfa4cd710dc30aae5febc4feacca29d23a60086ae", "ja": "確かにずっと楽しそうだったな。笑顔が印象的で、\nオフショットの枚数も結構な数になったな。", "zh": "确实，你一直看起来很开心呢。那笑容让我印象深刻，\n幕后花絮照片也拍了不少。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1010_007ior", "source_sha256": "607c29538fbe3970461c035032f5eb305eef51bfc428228c0cdd54d31528717d", "ja": "オフショット？　ああ、そういえばアンタ、\nちょこちょこ、近くでうろうろしてたわね。", "zh": "花絮照？啊，这么说来，你确实三天两头在附近晃悠呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "50c09cde604a8da5df3df750488363817a6c08e90759b96dce9ae32ba55f8eb0", "ja": "なにフラフラしてるのよ！　って、お説教して\nあげようかと思ってたけど……そんなことしてたの？", "zh": "我本来还想训你一顿，说什么“你在附近晃来晃去干什么呢！”……原来你是在做那种事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1012_p", "source_sha256": "17d224e402e71ac14bdbc48a9e9fdd1f09e505c34b6d89a1263033afe2e928bc", "ja": "伊織、いい顔してたからな、これは……と思って。\nたとえばほら、この写真とか。", "zh": "因为伊织当时的表情很好看，我就觉得这张……应该不错。\n比如，你看这张照片。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1013_007ior", "source_sha256": "89a2c2b0b4a32ccefcf150821844fff54befd9764422f50c7e35286b475700ba", "ja": "どれどれ……お菓子作り中の写真ね。へぇ。\n確かによく撮れてる……、私、こんな顔してたのね。", "zh": "让我看看……是在做点心时拍的照片啊。哦。\n\n确实拍得很好……原来我当时是这种表情啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1014_007ior", "source_sha256": "08a4f556580282b20daee16d4f3742d72f1b09bddd6c234886a1a9da8fe8718a", "ja": "うん……他の写真もいいわね。で？　あんたは\nこの写真を、どうするつもりなのかしら？", "zh": "嗯……其他的照片也很不错嘛。然后呢？你\n打算拿这些照片怎么样呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1015_p", "source_sha256": "c4ec6ec81d906c811c501c17ebab9921a03df2b1a29034caa875fd50617ec72d", "ja": "ああ。宣伝用の写真も、伊織が考えただけあって、\n完璧ないい出来になるとは思うけど……。", "zh": "嗯。宣传用的照片，毕竟是伊织构思的，我觉得也会是完美的成品，不过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1016_p", "source_sha256": "8cdb3526fb29d99f835dcab5f1aa315cf0798795ebd905569dcad3fc5ed3152f", "ja": "こういう素の魅力も、一緒に発信できたら\nまた違った宣伝になるかなと思って。どうかな？", "zh": "如果能把这种自然流露的魅力也一起宣传出去，或许会成为一种不一样的宣传方式。你觉得呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1017_007ior", "source_sha256": "2728fed1af2b829ba387e7f707285e7a5fc736fce59ee62a8fa0e3b19149dbdc", "ja": "……これは、私自身にはできないアプローチね。\nなるほど。アンタにしては悪くない案だと思うわ。", "zh": "……这种切入点，我自己确实做不来呢。\n原来如此。对你来说，倒是个挺不错的提议嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1018_p", "source_sha256": "4670b4ee60e790b4e2584b0f14a41e02642dff41ad29b08f227551f46c1bd11a", "ja": "はは、それはよかった。伊織こだわりの販促案を\nより良いものにできるなら、嬉しいよ。", "zh": "哈哈，那就好。要是能让伊织精心构思的促销方案变得更好，我也很高兴。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1019_007ior", "source_sha256": "14cdd7634c786a3253adf68bac5b90cb835baf67909d345c5a63b1102b7c7693", "ja": "にひひっ、いい心掛けね。\n今日ばかりは、素直に褒めてあげるわ♪", "zh": "嘻嘻，这份心意不错嘛。今天就破例，坦率地夸夸你吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_007ior0474_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_007ior0474_1020_007ior", "source_sha256": "d42901cf6cfe74c5c67fac78cdea541a0686bfd338ae8520d6e8bd7936764911", "ja": "私も負けてられないわね。ファンのみんなに喜んで\nもらえるように……最高の一枚を撮ってみせるわ♪", "zh": "我也不能输啊。为了让粉丝们开心……我一定要拍出最棒的一张♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
